DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hls.itunes.apple.com,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple.news,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN,news.apple.com,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN,news-assets.apple.com,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN,news-client.apple.com,APPLE-PROXY
