# Apple 智能/PCC 独立端点；代理不等于解除地区、账户或设备资格限制。
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com,APPLE-PROXY
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com,APPLE-PROXY

